<div class="wrap">
<h1>JusPrin wording sweep, 6 November 2026</h1>
<p class="lede">This lists the places on JusPrin's own screens where a first-time user would misread the text or get stuck. Each one has a proposed rewording. Nothing has been changed in the code, and nothing has been put on the JusPrin v2 canvas. Green boxes record what Kenneth decided in his comments on 6 November; purple boxes are still proposals.</p>
<p class="sub">Text and code were checked on the <code>jusprin-newui-integration</code> branch. Each problem shows the screen, the exact text, what a person would think, the proposal, where the code shows the proposal is true, and who caught it.</p>
<div class="legend">
  <span><span class="tag cr">Cold reader caught it</span> A fresh agent who only saw the screenshots flagged this.</span>
  <span><span class="tag own">Only my reading</span> The cold reader passed over it; I found it reading the screen against the code.</span>
</div>
